      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِصْمَادٌ</span></b>  A she-camel <i>that endures cold, and
drought,</i> or <i>barrenness of the earth, continuing to
yield her milk:</i> pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَصَامِدُ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَصَامِيدُ</span>. (K.)

